# The flat floor and a host camera that draws (flag 1) from above and to the side of the glove. The glove and the
# ball move as without it. Its far distance (4000) becomes the game's farPlaneDist, which decides the actors that the
# game updates, so the random seed can differ from a run without the view (docs/host-world.md, "The camera").
tri -600 0 -600  -600 0 600  600 0 600  0
tri -600 0 -600  600 0 600  600 0 -600  0
place 0 hand 0 40 0 ball 0 40 60 yaw 0 camera
view 0 1  250 200 -250  0 10 0  0 1 0  50 1.7777778 10 4000
